{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cardrottini</strong> is a fast-paced, turn-based card battler powered by the most unhinged corners of Italian internet culture. From Tung Tung Tung Sahur to Ballerina Capuccina and Tralalero Tralala, every card is a tribute to the beautiful nonsense that clogs your feed at 2AM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Unlock Wild Cards:</strong> Progress through battles and challenges to <strong>unlock new cards</strong> featuring viral characters, chaotic catchphrases, and pure meme energy. Every unlocked card adds fresh madness to your deck and opens up new strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/extras/55d2a3e91f09f2a58b7339b94cb0ed15.poster.avif?t=1748854967\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/extras/55d2a3e91f09f2a58b7339b94cb0ed15.webm?t=1748854967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/extras/55d2a3e91f09f2a58b7339b94cb0ed15.mp4?t=1748854967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Merge for Ultimate Power:\u00a0</strong>Take things further by merging cards! Combine your favorite memes to create supercharged versions with enhanced abilities. Experiment with fusions to discover the most ridiculous and powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/extras/59f0985afed654bbc6ba1a3d6fe8e3c5.poster.avif?t=1748854967\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/extras/59f0985afed654bbc6ba1a3d6fe8e3c5.webm?t=1748854967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/extras/59f0985afed654bbc6ba1a3d6fe8e3c5.mp4?t=1748854967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Outplay or Outweird:</strong> Outsmart opponents with clever strategies - or just throw the weirdest combo possible and hope they tilt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Play With (or Against) Friends:</strong> Casual duels or competitive ranked matches, full of emotional damage and unexpected laughter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Regular Drops of Madness:</strong> New cards, seasonal events, and community-fueled chaos. The meta may not exist. That\u2019s the point.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know, you know. If you don\u2019t\u2026 you will.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win tutorial match","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723480/6942624ac4d1b1a18bbcfb2dbf6f0f4e64822431.jpg"},{"name":"First card merged!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723480/cc3acd69edc335b7b45517297d360a5f3cb34c97.jpg"},{"name":"Win 10 matches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723480/58d970314be1f5512608c0093a5161d98de5c76b.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock legendary card","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723480/962abf66d139373b34fd4b00f14f0baf6da2d63b.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723480?t=1748854967","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723480?t=1748854967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/96bd0c3de19c5e3ab76c54bc0a